{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"seasonal-sinking-gnu","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context / Problem\nOn current origin/main at dcc90ced4 plus clarity commit 850db7297, enabled local `rebar review-code` fails before reviewing the diff because the activated `project.review-phase-boundaries` criterion cannot resolve its committed project prompt. The prompt asset exists at `.rebar/prompts/code-review-project-review-phase-boundaries.md`, and its offline contract tests pass in the full suite.\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n1. From the repository worktree, place `.venv/bin` first on `PATH`.\n2. Run `REBAR_VERIFY_ENABLE_CODE_REVIEW=1 rebar review-code --base origin/main --head HEAD --output text`.\n3. Repeat with `--source local`.\n\n## Actual\nBoth variants exit 1 with `unknown prompt code-review-project-review-phase-boundaries`; the listed known prompts contain built-ins only. No diff finding or review verdict is produced.\n\n## Expected\nThe enabled code-review path resolves committed project prompts from the applicable repository root for both attested and local sources, then returns an actual review verdict.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A regression test reproduces project-prompt resolution through enabled `review-code`.\n- [ ] Enabled local-source review resolves the committed project prompt.\n- [ ] Enabled attested-source review resolves the committed project prompt.\n- [ ] Missing project prompt assets still fail with a precise configuration error.\n- [ ] Focused tests, lint, typecheck, and the full repository suite pass.","id":"82c4-de24-bef8-49a5","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["code-review","prompts","regression"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"review-code cannot resolve an activated project prompt"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785195945673073001,"uuid":"886c8951-5ffa-4488-b6af-5ebf04affe9a"}